[`Mathlib/Logic/Function/Basic.lean`](https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/db584cd6d46c92f209a44c0f1c829460d327499d/Mathlib/Logic/Function/Basic.lean)
states factorization from constancy on fibres, with a nonempty ambient
codomain for extension. It is an abstract factorization statement,
not an acquisition algorithm. The separate fibre proofs in §§3, 5
and 6 supply the precise conditions used here; no worldwide absence
or novelty conclusion is inferred from a search.

